---
import { CONTACT } from "@/consts";

const title = "Michael Bui";
const description = "Michael Bui is an AI Research & Product Engineer and founder building practical AI systems, products, and software.";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="author" content="Michael Bui" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://michaeltechs.xyz/all-about-me" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=mc" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main data-pagefind-body>
      <h1>Michael Bui</h1>

      <img
        class="portrait"
        src="/assets/all-about-me/michael.webp"
        width="140"
        height="140"
        alt="Michael Bui"
        decoding="sync"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href={CONTACT.github} rel="me">kyoo-147</a> on GitHub</li>
          <li><a href={CONTACT.linkedin} rel="me">Michael Bui</a> on LinkedIn</li>
          <li><a href={CONTACT.x} rel="me">@mih_cuog</a> on X</li>
          <li><a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a> via email</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Interests</h2>
        <p>
          I love to build practical AI systems and products. I am especially interested in model
          research, machine learning, computer vision, AI agents, embedded AI, automation,
          developer tools, and human-centered technology. I also enjoy books, drawing, science,
          robotics, engines, and space. I sometimes <a href="/posts">write about what I learn</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Current work</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            I am Co-Founder and CTO at Dynamic Industrial Equipment Company Limited, building
            technology for industrial equipment, production automation, and AI-powered
            manufacturing workflows.
          </li>
          <li>
            I am the founder of <a href="https://navinresearch.com">Navin Research</a>, an AI
            research and product initiative focused on practical software systems, optimization,
            and automation.
          </li>
          <li>
            My long-term goal is to become a product-minded engineer who can turn ambitious ideas
            into useful and reliable systems.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/together-working">Together Working</a>: a local control plane for
            coordinating coding agents, task contracts, approvals, and verification gates.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/dossier">Dossier</a>: document intelligence for PDFs, scans, forms,
            tables, handwriting, validation, and human review.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/workwise">WorkWise</a>: an AI-assisted workflow control layer for
            operational requests involving money, risk, policy, and approvals.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/everdock-desktop">EverDock Desktop</a>: a desktop control plane for AI
            coding agents running locally, over SSH, and on managed servers.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/sandora">Sandora</a>: a platform for configuring multi-agent teams,
            departments, tools, workflows, approval gates, and audit logs.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/moyi-edge-translation">MoYi Edge Translation</a>: edge-first,
            privacy-aware translation infrastructure for factories and multilingual operations.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/snow-ai-companion">Snow AI Companion</a>: a child-safe AI companion
            focused on controlled conversation, routine support, and parent oversight.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/oneclick-crm">YI-OneClick</a>: an AI-assisted CRM and workflow platform
            for leads, customers, deals, quotations, follow-ups, and business operations.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/autonomous-vehicle-research">Autopilot &amp; FSD — BFMC</a>: a scale-model
            autonomous vehicle combining perception, planning, control, and embedded AI. I led the
            2024–2025 team.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/computer-vision-qc-system">Pharmaceutical QC Defect Detection Machine</a>:
            an industrial vision project covering data collection, defect design, training,
            validation, cameras, industrial PCs, and edge deployment. I worked as Project Manager.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/maritime-vms">Maritime VMS Management System</a>: a vessel operations
            system for satellite connectivity, bandwidth control, GPS data, and operational
            visibility.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/gardon">Gardon SmartThinks</a>: an archived smart-garden system using
            ESP32, MQTT, web and mobile applications, and a local voice assistant.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/dotx-aero">DotX Aero</a>: an archived local-first smart-home voice and
            IoT architecture using Vietnamese speech, local models, MQTT, and ESP32 devices.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/travel-booking-agent">Travel Booking Agent</a>: an archived travel
            planning system using microservices, retrieval, memory, search, and automated hotel
            communication.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/safex">SafeX</a>: an archived real-time computer-vision security and
            attendance project.
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/work/rabbit-signlink">Rabbit SignLink</a>: an archived sign-language learning
            and recognition prototype for accessibility research.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>Source and additional project history can be found on <a href={CONTACT.github}>GitHub</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Writing</h2>
        <p>I write technical notes, project reflections, and research explainers.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/posts/building-practical-ai-systems">Building Practical AI Systems</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="/posts/beyond-bigger-models-ai-research">Beyond Bigger Models: New Directions
              in AI Model Research</a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/posts/kimi-k3-explained">Kimi K3 Explained</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="/posts/ai-engineer-business-workflow">Why AI Engineers Need to Understand
              Business Workflows, Not Just Models</a>
          </li>
          <li><a href="/posts">All writing</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">Full portfolio</a></li>
          <li><a href="/work">Work archive</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gallery">Personal gallery</a></li>
          <li><a href="/Founder_BuiMinhCuong.pdf">Résumé (PDF)</a></li>
          <li><a href={CONTACT.youtube}>YouTube</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  html { background: #686868; }
  body { margin: 0; color: #000; font-family: "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.35; }
  main { width: min(1056px, calc(100% - 64px)); min-height: calc(100vh - 30px); margin: 15px auto 0; padding: 18px 32px 48px; background: #fff; }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.1; }
  h2 { margin: 18px 0 12px; font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.15; }
  p { margin: 0 0 14px; }
  ul { margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 40px; }
  li { margin: 4px 0; }
  a { color: #0000ee; }
  .portrait { float: right; width: 140px; height: 140px; margin: 0 0 24px 40px; object-fit: cover; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    html { background: #fff; }
    body { font-size: 16px; }
    main { width: 100%; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; padding: 18px 16px 40px; }
    h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    h2 { font-size: 25px; }
    ul { padding-left: 28px; }
    .portrait { width: 112px; height: 112px; margin-left: 20px; }
  }

  @media print {
    html { background: #fff; }
    main { width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  }
</style>
